# Authenticated LGX command preparation boundary

Import AlejandroCatalog from "./alejandro_catalog.lg".
Import AlejandroProvenance from "./alejandro_provenance.lg".
Import AlejandroRevision from "./alejandro_revision.lg".
Import AlejandroRevisionColumns from "./alejandro_revision_columns.lg".

## To prepareAlejandroProblem (manifestRaw: Text, sourceRaw: Text, ledgerRaw: Text, pins: AlejandroPins) -> Result of AlejandroRevisionDraft and Text:
    If length of text_bytes(manifestRaw) is greater than 16777216:
        Return a new Err with error "manifest exceeds admission limit".
    If alejandroOriginalPinsAccepted(pins) is equal to false:
        Return a new Err with error "original pins rejected".
    If alejandroRawMatches(manifestRaw, pins's manifestDigest) is equal to false:
        Return a new Err with error "raw manifest hash mismatch".
    Inspect decodeAlejandroCatalog(manifestRaw):
        When Err (failure):
            Return a new Err with error failure.
        When Ok (catalog):
            Repeat for original in catalog's cases:
                If original's caseId is equal to pins's caseId:
                    Return assembleAlejandroRevision(original, sourceRaw, ledgerRaw, pins).
    Return a new Err with error "case absent from original catalog".
## To prepareAlejandroRevisionColumns (manifestRaw: Text, sourceRaw: Text, ledgerRaw: Text, pins: AlejandroPins) -> Result of Json and Text:
    Inspect prepareAlejandroProblem(manifestRaw, sourceRaw, ledgerRaw, pins):
        When Ok (draft):
            Return a new Ok with value alejandroRevisionColumns(draft).
        When Err (failure):
            Return a new Err with error failure.
    Return a new Err with error "problem preparation failed".
